{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1501862-homebrew-seoul-contagion-of-causality","id":1501862,"title":"[Homebrew] Seoul: Contagion of Causality","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-02-01T03:51:16-08:00","id":1501862,"title":"[Homebrew] Seoul: Contagion of Causality","content":"<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1i7qG0_C44o8r45hnWT1dIE1nrmS90MGXwQFRCREwo1U/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"><b><span style=\"font-size:20px\">Seoul</span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\">Contagion of Causality</span></b></a></div> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div align=\"center\">Chaos is found in greatest abundance wherever order is being sought. It always defeats order, because it is better organized.<br /> <br /> -Terry Pratchett, Interesting Times: The Play\u200b</div> <br /> </div> </div> </div>This is a homebrew Contagion outbreak in Seoul, the capital of the Republic of Korea. (As I live here, I believe I have a fairly decent claim to doing so.) Over 13k words total - I haven't directly compared it to the outbreaks in the original CC, but I largely mimicked its format.<br /> <br /> Splat focus: Demon, Mage, Werewolf; though of course there is plenty of room for other gamelines (in fact, Seoul is canonically a place of interest for Prometheans - and yes I do bring that up).<br /> <br /> Also features: 3/5 Attainments for a homebrew Abyssal Legacy - Machinepox (\uae30\ud658\ub9c8\ub9c8); Mystery Cult Initiation Merit for the Demiurge Device, a Naglfar's Army faction. A <i>lot</i> of references to preexisting lore and books, not all of which are from the focused splats. <hr />God, looking at the Gdocs history (and the link to it is the title link, yes), it's been more than a month and a half since I started this. Probably longer if we count my daydreaming and the various ideas that became the genesis of this project. And that's not counting the time it took for the account to get approved. (Yes, this is my first post. Probably would have made an account much sooner if it wasn't for the forums being down for most of the time spent writing this.)<br /> <br /> Anyways - yeah, it's here, if you've been on the official CofD Discord server you may have seen me shamelessly plug - I mean <i>enthusiastically talk about</i> - it. I... have sadly not had any serious play experience whatsoever, but I've been reading the PDFs for a long time and I've gotten feedback and referred to how the official books did it. (I swear half the reading I did for this that wasn't the Contagion Chronicles book itself was Night Horrors: Nameless and Accursed.)<br /> <br /> Feedback is welcome - I think it's at least good enough to share at large and I've gotten a couple people read it, but more is always helpful.<br /> <br /> Thanks to Tonkers77, who gave a lot of advice and encouragement, Acrozatarim, who I got a lot of insight as to confirm the validity of my premise and understand the lore from, Rishi Dash and TrueMrMultiverse who kept up on the Discord thread for this project, and everyone else who gave me feedback or otherwise made this possible. Couldn't have stuck with this 'til the end without all you guys.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27777,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27777-danielxcutter","user":"danielxcutter","date":". 02-01-2023, 10:57 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27777-danielxcutter","name":"danielxcutter","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"18"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-0